{"channelId":"UCS6J56TITADsMhvgl6C02pA","row":["PARR PT Physical Therapy",5780,"Welcome to the Parr PT channel.\n\nWe provide specialized physical therapy treatments in Austin & Houston for: EDS (Ehlers-Danlos Syndrome), hypermobility, Dysautonomia, POTS, chronic pain & chronic fatigue (e.g. Fibromyalgia), neurological disorders & brain injuries such as strokes and MS, sports rehab & injury prevention for athletes, scar tissue release, bowel disorders (constipation, IBS, gastroparesis), and Matrix gait training.\n\nOur expert physical therapists have years of experience in helping people with complex conditions to lead healthier and happier lives (https://parrpt.com/patient-testimonials/). At our clinic, you can expect personalized, one-on-one treatments tailored exactly to your needs:\n\nThe Parr PT Method = Specific myokinesethics techniques + Hands-on manual therapy + A holistic exercise approach to PT = Optimal Results!\n\nContact us directly today: https://parrpt.com/contact-and-scheduling/\n\nJonathan Parr PT, CSCS EP MCMT CBIS","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCS6J56TITADsMhvgl6C02pA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCS6J56TITADsMhvgl6C02pA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:03:25.711Z","channelId":"UCS6J56TITADsMhvgl6C02pA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"e274bcf13c85c7b2fc9f0aafb49ec8259c455d80947037ac5258a285fca02691","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"5d1e29f8be3db890e9771912da7e8975ad5605e3c9b5e00bfe6e3726f11b1f33"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCS6J56TITADsMhvgl6C02pA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:03:25.711Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCS6J56TITADsMhvgl6C02pA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":5780,"raw":"5.78K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCS6J56TITADsMhvgl6C02pA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:03:25.711Z"}],"emails":[],"contac